    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Say baws, what year's this vintage?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_105_emper"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Hmm, maderized coloring, lively aroma, robust flavor, velvety texture, this is..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Last month. A forty of malt liquor from the corner store."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_105_emper",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Perfect scores up and down, baws! That's why they call ya Lungmen's self-proclaimed number one sow-mel-eer!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_105_emper"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "*Pfft* How many times do I gotta tell you? This is a reserve weapon. It ain't for drinking! Sora!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_105_emper",
            "name2": "char_101_sora_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "Okay, okay, here's your mouthwash."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Um... did ya mean to wash yer mouth with Yan huangjiu...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_102_texas_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Alcohol is a disinfectant. There's industrial alcohol under the bar. That would do the trick."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "S'all good. We got money so we might as well spend it. It's all in the process, y'know? Ain't the amount. It's the process of spending!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#8"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Everybody, the apple pie's ready! It's time to party!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Oooh~ Exusiai's homemade apple pie!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_105_emper"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 8,
            "ystrength": 6,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 20,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Bottoms up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#8",
            "name2": "char_101_sora_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "...so like, what exactly are we partying for?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
            "name2": "char_101_sora_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Huh? It's Bison's welcome party."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
            "name2": "char_101_sora_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "...so like, where's Bison?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#6",
            "name2": "char_101_sora_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Um! I dunno!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_105_emper"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Emperor",
        "text": "Then pick another reason. We always got a reason to party."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
